12
00:01:07.164 --> 00:01:10.747
Output. Say it with me. Output!

13
00:01:14.218 --> 00:01:24.320
A good prompt gives context, a role, and an example. You can ask for a format and add a constraint. If the output is not right, iterate and improve the prompt.

